        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Victorian Rope Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis victorian design door pull is reminiscent of the late 1800's,  elaborate yet graceful, that embellished the european homes of the noble and wealthy.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis door pull can be used in many applications, and is designed to bring a level of bold style to your entry doors, glass shower door, retail store door.... \r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also available: <a href=\"/products/victorian-rope-appliance-pull-first-impressions-cfmbp\"><b>Victorian Rope Refrigerator Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis very decorative victorian rope design pull handle is <b>1-3/16\" Diameter</b> with a <b>3\" projection</b>.  Each one is hand made by the master craftsmen at First Impressions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions MBP  Victorian Rope Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 5</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/victorian-pulls-detail-picture.jpg?v=1718159599\" target=\"new\"><b>FII-MBP Detailed Picture</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 different standard lengths.</b>\r\n<li>FII-MBP-14: Total Length 14\" - Center to Center Mount - 12-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-MBP-16: Total Length 16\" - Center to Center Mount - 14-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-MBP-18: Total Length 18\" - Center to Center Mount - 16-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-MBP-20: Total Length 20\" - Center to Center Mount - 18-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-MBP-24: Total Length 24\" - Center to Center Mount - 22-3/8\"</li>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>NOTE</b> - These door pull comes standard with the  <a href=\"/products/2-3-4-inch-round-door-pull-rosette-first-impressions-dlw01002r\">2-3/4\" Diameter Round Smoth Rosettes</a> for an extra level of decoration. The rosettes are removable if desired. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This victorian design door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 5 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts through the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Victorian Rope Door Pull, First Impressions MBP",
                "description": "Victorian Rope  Door Pull - This victorian design is reminiscent of the late 1800's,  elaborate yet graceful. Available in 5 standard lengths from 14 - 24 inches and 5 different finishes including Oil Rubbed Bronze and Aged Brass.",
